{"4294980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Binary Breach", "steam_appid": 4294980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/e2ca4e723b642b573984dcaa17c75c13.poster.avif?t=1778946861\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/e2ca4e723b642b573984dcaa17c75c13.webm?t=1778946861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/e2ca4e723b642b573984dcaa17c75c13.mp4?t=1778946861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>GET RICH OR GET DELETED.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Binary Breach</strong> is an asymmetric co-op game that fuses 3D precision platforming with 2D strategic hacking. One player takes the role of a sentient virus inside the system. The other plays as the external hacker guiding them and controlling the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, the pair must infiltrate a collapsing blockchain to breach the firewalls of an ultra-secure crypto wallet. The goal is to steal the assets before the system deletes the connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There is no solo mode. The team lives or dies as a pair.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/51a047c46efff093bc0a48d0393e9d32.poster.avif?t=1778946861\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/51a047c46efff093bc0a48d0393e9d32.webm?t=1778946861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/51a047c46efff093bc0a48d0393e9d32.mp4?t=1778946861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>TWO MINDS, ONE BREACH</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAYER 1: THE RUNNER (3D)</strong> <br>The Runner traverses the system’s architecture from within. Without a map or radar, they rely entirely on the operator to know what lies around the corner. <br><i>Gameplay: Precision Platforming, Wall-Jumping, Air-Strafing.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAYER 2: THE OPERATOR (2D)</strong> <br>The Operator views the heist through a retro-futuristic terminal. They act as the mastermind to edit reality. The Operator hacks doors, spawns platforms, and overrides physics to carry the Runner across the finish line. <br><i>Gameplay: Environment Control, Tactical Hacking, Minigames.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/e141337a8c9467797d8ff39c2763d42e.poster.avif?t=1778946861\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/e141337a8c9467797d8ff39c2763d42e.webm?t=1778946861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/e141337a8c9467797d8ff39c2763d42e.mp4?t=1778946861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TIME IS MONEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is the only resource. Every second spent in the preparation sectors deducts directly from the final extraction window.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun</strong> the security layers to preserve the connection time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maximize</strong> the remaining duration in the extraction phase to drain the wallet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape</strong> before the system collapse to secure the payout.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/e2ca4e723b642b573984dcaa17c75c13.poster.avif?t=1778946861\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/e2ca4e723b642b573984dcaa17c75c13.webm?t=1778946861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/e2ca4e723b642b573984dcaa17c75c13.mp4?t=1778946861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>GET RICH OR GET DELETED.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Binary Breach</strong> is an asymmetric co-op game that fuses 3D precision platforming with 2D strategic hacking. One player takes the role of a sentient virus inside the system. The other plays as the external hacker guiding them and controlling the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, the pair must infiltrate a collapsing blockchain to breach the firewalls of an ultra-secure crypto wallet. The goal is to steal the assets before the system deletes the connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There is no solo mode. The team lives or dies as a pair.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294980/extras/51a047c46efff093bc0a48d